{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4VMVw12o7dv9EpH15i","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me.*\n\n*I am plain. Iron-black. Cold to the touch. A single keyhole rests at my center like an unblinking eye.*\n\n*There is no handle.*\n\n*The wood around my keyhole is worn smooth by centuries of fingers tracing its edges, searching. The metal of my lock is ancient — not rusted, but darkened, as if stained by the weight of what waits behind me.*\n\n*I do not creak. I do not rattle. I am perfectly, terribly still.*\n\n*You feel it, don't you? The faint pull of warm air through the keyhole. Something breathing on the other side. Or perhaps that's just the draft.*\n\n*Insert the key.*\n\n*If you have one.*\n\n🔑🕳️"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":179,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}